    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "PCI bus overview",
      "source_hash": 2979589308007350831,
      "context_hash": 1358888715945251066,
      "translation": "PCI 버스 개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PCI": "PCI"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178787Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "PCI (Peripheral Component Interconnect) is the standard bus for connecting devices to a CPU.",
      "source_hash": 703078332747888238,
      "context_hash": 3769058604061435095,
      "translation": "PCI(Peripheral Component Interconnect)는 디바이스를 CPU에 연결하는 표준 버스입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "PCI": "PCI",
        "devices": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178787Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "PCIe (PCI Express) is the modern serial version, but the driver API is largely the same.",
      "source_hash": 12892103884181163742,
      "context_hash": 2697308352002194642,
      "translation": "PCIe(PCI Express)는 현대적인 직렬 버전이지만, 드라이버 API는 대체로 동일합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "PCI": "PCI",
        "PCIe": "PCIe",
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178787Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The `pci_register_driver()` API and `struct pci_driver` were introduced in Linux 2.4, replacing the ad-hoc probing style of 2.2 and earlier [(Linux Device Drivers, 3rd ed., ch. 12)](https://lwn.net/Kernel/LDD3/).",
      "source_hash": 6105386208525186111,
      "context_hash": 16987762585535461031,
      "translation": "`pci_register_driver()` API와 `struct pci_driver`는 Linux 2.4에서 도입되어 2.2 이전의 임시방편적인 디바이스 탐색(probing) 방식을 대체했습니다 [(Linux Device Drivers, 3rd ed., ch. 12)](https://lwn.net/Kernel/LDD3/).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:25:52.809640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Registering a PCI driver",
      "source_hash": 10703153280003014827,
      "context_hash": 18284942505337756504,
      "translation": "PCI 드라이버 등록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PCI": "PCI",
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178788Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel calls `probe()` when a matching device is found (at boot, hot-plug, or module load).",
      "source_hash": 1807250168363632120,
      "context_hash": 14904819534533615555,
      "translation": "커널은 일치하는 디바이스를 발견하면(부팅 시, 핫플러그 시 또는 모듈 로드 시) `probe()`를 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "module": "모듈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178788Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Probe function",
      "source_hash": 12098446226198385962,
      "context_hash": 14144784269623188868,
      "translation": "Probe 함수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178788Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "BAR mapping and MMIO access",
      "source_hash": 16226055460243854679,
      "context_hash": 10336354893171943404,
      "translation": "BAR 매핑과 MMIO 접근",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MMIO": "MMIO",
        "mapping": "매핑"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178788Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "BARs (Base Address Registers) are the windows through which the CPU accesses device memory/registers:",
      "source_hash": 3061488987052593531,
      "context_hash": 15155064836982530966,
      "translation": "BAR(Base Address Register)는 CPU가 디바이스 메모리/레지스터에 접근하는 창구입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178788Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Always use `ioread*`/`iowrite*` (not plain pointer dereference) for MMIO regions — they handle architecture-specific memory ordering and MMIO semantics.",
      "source_hash": 17431186323010976773,
      "context_hash": 4833727202218418195,
      "translation": "MMIO 영역에는 항상 (일반 포인터 역참조가 아니라) `ioread*`/`iowrite*`를 사용하십시오. 이 함수들은 아키텍처별 메모리 순서(memory ordering)와 MMIO 의미론을 처리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MMIO": "MMIO",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178789Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "MSI and MSI-X interrupts",
      "source_hash": 6313549107173475737,
      "context_hash": 13896280785808643006,
      "translation": "MSI 및 MSI-X 인터럽트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MSI": "MSI",
        "MSI-X": "MSI-X",
        "interrupts": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178789Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Modern devices use MSI (Message Signaled Interrupts) instead of legacy edge/level INTx signals.",
      "source_hash": 14529669302079738088,
      "context_hash": 4986623460700734715,
      "translation": "최신 디바이스는 레거시 edge/level INTx 신호 대신 MSI(Message Signaled Interrupts, 메시지 기반 인터럽트)를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MSI": "MSI",
        "devices": "디바이스",
        "interrupts": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178789Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "MSI was introduced in the PCI 2.2 specification (1999); MSI-X, which allows up to 2048 independent vectors, was added in PCI 3.0 [(Wikipedia: Message Signaled Interrupts)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Message_Signaled_Interrupts):",
      "source_hash": 17258374509434530576,
      "context_hash": 13042880475031983278,
      "translation": "MSI는 PCI 2.2 사양(1999년)에서 도입되었으며, 최대 2048개의 독립적인 인터럽트 벡터를 허용하는 MSI-X는 PCI 3.0에서 추가되었습니다 [(Wikipedia: Message Signaled Interrupts)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Message_Signaled_Interrupts):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MSI": "MSI",
        "MSI-X": "MSI-X",
        "PCI": "PCI",
        "interrupts": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178789Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Legacy INTx**: shared pin, slow, requires IOAPIC programming",
      "source_hash": 5475531099606550492,
      "context_hash": 2108381184138487971,
      "translation": "**Legacy INTx**: 공유 핀, 느림, IOAPIC 프로그래밍 필요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178789Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**MSI**: single interrupt vector, device writes to a magic memory address",
      "source_hash": 9997524120178443029,
      "context_hash": 7513578909624447822,
      "translation": "**MSI**: 단일 인터럽트 벡터, 디바이스가 특수한 메모리 주소에 쓰기 수행",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MSI": "MSI",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:47:40.178790Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**MSI-X**: up to 2048 independent interrupt vectors, per-vector affinity",
      "source_hash": 4766540821586795800,
      "context_hash": 14969211004076201050,
      "translation": "**MSI-X**: 최대 2048개의 독립적인 인터럽트 벡터, 벡터별 어피니티",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MSI-X": "MSI-X",
        "affinity": "어피니티",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:25:52.809642Z",
      "issues": []
    },
